OL,3,AUS deportations to African countries
OL,4,Aunlawful and exploit suffering - rights
OL,5,Agroup
OL,6,
OL,7,FCampaign group Human Rights Watch (HRW)
OL,8,Fsays the deportation of migrants from
OL,9,Fthe US to third-party African countries
OL,10,Fis against the law and exploits
OL,11,Fsuffering to deter migration.
OL,13,F"Many, if not most" of the deportees
OL,14,Fhave no practical option but to return
OL,15,Fto their home countries regardless of
OL,16,Fthe harm they face there, HRW says in a
OL,17,Freport.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
