OL,3,AUS deportations to African countries
OL,4,Aunlawful and exploit suffering - rights
OL,5,Agroup
OL,6,
OL,7,FSince Donald Trump returned to the
OL,8,FWhite House in 2025, more than 500
OL,9,Fpeople have been sent to African
OL,10,Fcountries where they are not citizens,
OL,11,Fthe group says, citing US data.
OL,13,FThe US Department of Homeland Security
OL,14,F(DHS) said "third country removals are
OL,15,Fan essential public safety tool that
OL,16,Fremove the most dangerous criminal
OL,17,Fillegal aliens from our streets".
